{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>The pendants.</b> There is no fault with it; some say in the gate [i.e., it is a foreign loanword]." "<b>And the chains.</b> In the ears, and he translated it as Aramaic according to others." "<b>And the veils.</b> A unique word, on the cheeks."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:21.172590804Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}